        "Content": "Sizable detached family home with loads of potential.\nImmediate availability and move-in condition.\nExtra large garden space particularly suited for young children.\n29-house development on the edge of Baltinglass Town.\nSchools, Sports clubs and a wide range of community services within walking distance.\nDaily transport to Dublin City, Naas and Carlow Town."
      },
